---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout title="FerrFlow CLI" description="One binary for automated semantic versioning, changelogs, issue tracking, and secret management." lang="en">
  <header class="landing-header"><div class="landing-header-inner"><Navbar lang="en" activePage="home" /></div></header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[900px] h-[600px] rounded-full opacity-40" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #FFCBA4 0%, #FFE8D2 40%, transparent 70%);"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24 pb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-primary-700 text-xs font-medium">Open source</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-center font-black text-primary-950 tracking-tight leading-[0.95]">
        <span class="block text-7xl sm:text-8xl md:text-[7rem] lg:text-[8.5rem]">One binary.</span>
        <span class="block text-7xl sm:text-8xl md:text-[7rem] lg:text-[8.5rem] italic text-primary-600">Every workflow.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 text-center text-lg sm:text-xl text-primary-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Versioning, releases, changelogs, issue tracking, secrets, and AI automation. Install the FerrFlow CLI and manage your entire developer workflow from the terminal.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="https://github.com/FerrFlow-Org/FerrFlow/releases/latest" class="px-7 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-primary-200">Download</a>
        <a href="/docs/introduction" class="px-7 py-3 rounded-full border border-primary-300 text-primary-800 font-medium hover:bg-primary-100 transition-colors">Documentation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Terminal -->
  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-primary-200/60 border border-primary-200">
        <div class="bg-primary-950 px-4 py-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/70"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/70"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/70"></span>
          <span class="ml-3 text-xs text-primary-400 font-mono">ferrflow</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-primary-950 px-5 py-5 font-mono text-sm leading-7">
          <p><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">ferrflow release</span></p>
          <p class="text-primary-500">Scanning packages/api ...</p>
          <p><span class="text-primary-500">Bump </span><span class="text-primary-200">api</span><span class="text-primary-500"> 1.5.0 &rarr; </span><span class="text-green-400 font-medium">1.6.0</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-primary-500">Tag  </span><span class="text-primary-200">api@v1.6.0</span><span class="text-green-400 ml-2">&check;</span></p>
          <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">ferrflow issues create --title "Fix auth"</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-green-400">&check;</span><span class="text-primary-300"> Issue #43 created</span></p>
          <p class="mt-3"><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">ferrflow secrets inject -- npm test</span></p>
          <p class="text-primary-500">Injecting 3 secrets...</p>
          <p><span class="text-green-400">&check;</span><span class="text-primary-300"> All tests passed</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's inside -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-primary-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-primary-950 tracking-tight">Everything in one tool</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-primary-600">No plugins, no extensions. Every feature ships with the binary.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-10">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 7h.01M7 3h5c.512 0 1.024.195 1.414.586l7 7a2 2 0 010 2.828l-7 7a2 2 0 01-2.828 0l-7-7A2 2 0 013 12V7a4 4 0 014-4z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">Semantic versioning</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Reads conventional commits and determines the right bump. Supports semver, calver, sequential, and zerover strategies.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">Monorepo native</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Version multiple packages independently with shared paths, dependency chains, and per-package changelogs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">Changelog generation</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Structured, readable changelogs generated from your commits. Grouped by type, scoped per package.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">Issue tracking</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Create, list, and manage issues from the terminal. Synced to the web dashboard at app.ferrflow.com.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">Secret management</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Store, rotate, and inject secrets into CI pipelines. Encrypted at rest, project-scoped, no Vault needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-primary-950 text-lg">AI agent</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-primary-700 leading-relaxed">Classify issues, summarize sprints, and suggest priorities. Built-in intelligence across every workflow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Install -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-primary-50 border-t border-primary-100">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-primary-950 tracking-tight mb-8">Install in seconds</h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-primary-200 shadow-lg shadow-primary-200/40 text-left">
        <div class="bg-primary-950 px-5 py-5 font-mono text-sm leading-7">
          <p class="text-primary-500"># macOS / Linux</p>
          <p><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">curl -fsSL https://ferrflow.com/install.sh | sh</span></p>
          <p class="text-primary-500 mt-4"># npm</p>
          <p><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">npm install -g ferrflow</span></p>
          <p class="text-primary-500 mt-4"># Docker</p>
          <p><span class="text-primary-400">$ </span><span class="text-primary-100">docker run ghcr.io/ferrflow-org/ferrflow check</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-primary-600">Works on Linux, macOS, and Windows. Also available as a <a href="/docs/ci/github-actions" class="text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-800">GitHub Action</a> and <a href="/docs/ci/gitlab-ci" class="text-primary-600 underline hover:text-primary-800">GitLab CI template</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-primary-950">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-primary-50 tracking-tight">Start shipping</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-primary-400">Open source. Works with GitHub, GitLab, and self-hosted forges.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/FerrFlow-Org/FerrFlow" class="mt-10 inline-block px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-primary-600 text-white font-medium text-lg hover:bg-primary-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-primary-900/50">View on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .landing-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 50; background: rgba(255, 248, 242, 0.9); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); border-bottom: 1px solid #ffe8d2; }
  .landing-header-inner { max-width: 72rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; height: 4rem; display: flex; align-items: center; }
</style>
